{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8000_place", "source_sha256": "3049bd9429cb91d0cec7ee49a32c3e03ffd1aff5d93eb4f41f01b0ac001b4436", "ja": "遊園地", "zh": "游乐园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8001_p", "source_sha256": "7b7f3b92acc8a4d8eb4b52a6292e4b6f8086b7daf0d309ff3fb7a085b159acf3", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の撮影。のり子のテーマ\nは、最新型アトラクションを楽しむ『令和ギャル』だ）", "zh": "（正在拍摄偶像杂志的写真。可爱的主题是享受最新型游乐设施的“令和辣妹”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8002_043nor", "source_sha256": "bd085296d75877807225e03f5a857e3c202ef82fef8b4f8bf4ffd37d27cdd35f", "ja": "{$P$}、見て見て！\nバイク型のコースターだって！　すっごく楽しそう！", "zh": "{$P$}，快看快看！\n据说是摩托车造型的过山车！看起来超好玩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8003_p", "source_sha256": "7fc8d656ac25b0ded28add40754d95a1f74f31b162e714a34bcad5d9bf50842d", "ja": "はは、そうだな。楽しむのは構わないけど、\n特典用の動画撮影もあるから、忘れないように。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。玩得开心当然没问题，不过还要拍摄特典用的视频，可别忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8004_043nor", "source_sha256": "6f4acb3f340325a43b22fd14a906eafa9f11ecbe6f65d1d12a6dfc0f30236f3b", "ja": "うん、任せて。アトラクションの感想を\nギャルになりきって話すんだったよね？", "zh": "嗯，包在我身上。是要彻底扮成辣妹\n来聊聊游乐设施的感想对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8005_043nor", "source_sha256": "66cde088ab2bacc1c93bb41f2fc016f17a71824f7782da4a84c563ad6b8eafef", "ja": "うっ……アタシのギャル像がちょっと心配かも。\nねえ、ギャルってどんな感じで話してると思う？", "zh": "呃……我有点担心自己演出来的辣妹形象对不对了。\n呐，你觉得辣妹平时都是怎么说话的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8006_p", "source_sha256": "8aeac2663588fcdc073da5749de0f440bc4eaf45ef6d23aea839f37a30bff3b8", "ja": "ギャルの話し方か？　そうだな……。", "zh": "辣妹的说话方式吗？这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8007", "source_sha256": "69658ba3e4a0fde6ed1131a6667119b3375b0947809a77b8ba6d540b03606252", "ja": "キャパい", "zh": "容量不够", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8008", "source_sha256": "d03d73265061bb033c6ace72efa3221f1df24d55c9fb59d44ca2b6bd8d30c421", "ja": "あげぽよ", "zh": "嗨起来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8009", "source_sha256": "47e2530c5a55dedcc593fe54da37140a6769e0a6f5705726fb678f0d226fe59b", "ja": "チョベリグ", "zh": "超赞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8100_p", "source_sha256": "ede9042180bab1b04d37076d4150900870766c4a9dea6f58641f69f8586b9f3b", "ja": "「キャパい」とか使えるんじゃないか？　\nキャパオーバーとか、限界みたいな意味らしいけど。", "zh": "“キャパい”之类的词，不是也能用吗？\n好像是“超出承受能力”或者“到极限了”的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8101_043nor", "source_sha256": "74ec4525cb8104199c7786400b8f53a179612c4b19c67575c8d8c7043f06a7e7", "ja": "それ、聞いたことあるよ！　大学の授業で\n課題がいっぱい出た時、友達が言ってたんだよね。", "zh": "那个我听说过哦！大学上课时作业布置得太多，朋友就说过这句话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8102_043nor", "source_sha256": "5ae0f310567584c892c79ca61ad681967840c878cd9d9d7a292e76d5b70df27b", "ja": "あんな感じでいいなら……アタシもできる気がする！\nよーっし！　全力でギャルやってやる～！", "zh": "要是那种感觉就行的话……我觉得我也能做到！\n好——嘞！我要全力当辣妹啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8200_p", "source_sha256": "cd6fc5ab2468d3742c3bf3116e7160b5efd7761383abde5e7b7b5ad81d733eae", "ja": "「あげぽよ」、とか？　少し古いかもしれないけど、\nそういう言葉を使ってるイメージがあるかな。", "zh": "“嗨翻天”之类的？虽然可能有点过时了，\n不过总觉得辣妹会用这种词呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8201_043nor", "source_sha256": "59e66630677ab361db17ca0f6868ec5e747c44d1889ff641e1cc3e5b48b026db", "ja": "たしかに！　ギャル語を使ったら雰囲気が出るかも！\nまあ、実際に使うとなると難しいけど……。", "zh": "确实！要是用辣妹用语，说不定更有那种感觉呢！\n不过，真要用起来还是挺难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8202_043nor", "source_sha256": "9193d26df7db1d033bc58a0deb61a9d680739d59d3d2443a660b7d14f1e0c902", "ja": "まず言葉の意味を調べるところから始めなきゃ！\n{$P$}も、調べるの手伝って！", "zh": "得先从查词汇的意思开始才行！\n{$P$}也来帮我查吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8300_p", "source_sha256": "8420152fbb925a7ce36d9d1fe9cf3b3a412dbda83a6b63ca0d9aabf68acffba6", "ja": "「チョベリグ」「チョベリバ」……？", "zh": "“超赞”“超差”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8301_043nor", "source_sha256": "fc5dcda33fe7a89a27f52d50b7e5ae011f58376caa7ddbba76195d1d04a1fbc5", "ja": "あはは……聞いたことはあるけど、\n使ってる人は、あんまり見ないかな～……って。", "zh": "啊哈哈……我倒是听说过，不过好像不太常见有人用呢～……umyzyň", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_8302_043nor", "source_sha256": "b8c381e9cb9381cf2f8d8ae5f41bdc98f36b2d26d4c281dc179cf0bed8e4b6fe", "ja": "そういう言葉を使わなくても、テンション上げて\nノリよく話せば、ギャルっぽく見える……よね？", "zh": "就算不用那种说法，只要情绪高涨、聊得够嗨，看起来也会像辣妹……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
